(SteriPro 22B Vacuum Autoclave) Tj
T* (Operator Manual - Model SP-22B) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. INTENDED USE) Tj
T* (The SteriPro 22B is a class B vacuum steam steriliser for dental) Tj
T* (instruments. It has a 22 litre chamber and four validated cycles.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. SAFETY) Tj
T* (WARNING: The chamber door interlock must never be defeated. The) Tj
T* (chamber is a pressure vessel and opening it under pressure will) Tj
T* (cause serious scalding injury.) Tj
T* (WARNING: Isolate the unit at the wall before removing any panel.) Tj
T* (Servicing behind the rear panel is for a qualified engineer only.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
