stream
BT
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
56 720 Td
(3. DAILY OPERATION) Tj
T* (3.1 Fill the clean water reservoir to the MAX line with distilled) Tj
T* (water only. Tap water will scale the heater and void the warranty.) Tj
T* (3.2 Empty the waste reservoir at the start of every session.) Tj
T* (3.3 Load instruments in the trays supplied, hinged instruments open,) Tj
T* (with a 10 mm gap between pouches so steam can circulate.) Tj
T* (3.4 Select the cycle: 134 C Universal for wrapped loads, 134 C Fast) Tj
T* (for unwrapped solid instruments, 121 C Delicate for handpieces.) Tj
T* (3.5 Confirm the printout shows the plateau held for the full) Tj
T* (sterilisation hold time before releasing the load.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
