BT
/F1 11 Tf
14 TL
56 720 Td
(4. TROUBLESHOOTING) Tj
T* (E01 - Water low. Refill the clean reservoir and restart the cycle.) Tj
T* (E02 - Waste full. Drain the waste reservoir using the front tap.) Tj
T* (E04 - Door not sealed. Reseat the load, check nothing fouls the) Tj
T* (gasket, wipe the gasket with a damp lint free cloth and retry.) Tj
T* (E07 - Vacuum test failed. Run the leak test with an empty chamber) Tj
T* (after a cold start. If it fails twice, call the service engineer.) Tj
T* (E11 - Temperature sensor fault. Stop using the unit and call the) Tj
T* (service engineer. Do not attempt to recalibrate the sensor.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. SERVICE) Tj
T* (Annual pressure vessel inspection and a service every 12 months or) Tj
T* (1000 cycles, whichever is sooner. Record every service in the) Tj
T* (practice equipment log.) Tj
ET
endstream
